 are basic, just change your colors.\nLangur Run is still brand new, so expect bugs. \n\nHave fun!", "short_description": "This is Langur Run, an experience similar to Gorilla Tag! Check out the brand-new shop! \nwith a whole bunch of cosmetics to put on and style your Langur, be careful don't spend all of your money!"}]}, "developer_name": "star.mp4", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1QurlQWMRUzCsKiDm8TAioVnUPAja2EDaUWmd-ZDEzKg/edit?usp=sharing", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "star.mp4/Doritoz", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@LangurRun", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "8619702564787381"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "https://scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001705_2470195483176943_3388188711557977575_n.png?stp=dst-png_s360x360&_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6m3RFgBZlwYQ7kNvwGuOtwi&_nc_oc=AdrpnA7mHZZyvSqyzGxTO7DHuYTsxRNGBCYHHI8WROIUQdI7Zp_erY9v-nQ9kAoTl5M&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-atl3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af3bxr3d17_A9ilMR5TMCBIi0qII8APXhrn5oMPyPokdjA&oe=69F20238"}, "is_concept": false, "is_test": false, "is_trial_offer_valid": false, "display_name": "Langur Run", "platform": "ANDROID_6DOF", "context_category": {"context_category": "GAMES", "id": "2743326035925534"}, "context_topics"